{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/extras/ed82adb4867a9d7280064043da77f55c.poster.avif?t=1749263930\" width=650 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/extras/ed82adb4867a9d7280064043da77f55c.webm?t=1749263930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/extras/ed82adb4867a9d7280064043da77f55c.mp4?t=1749263930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take care of your pet. Boost your productivity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PomoPet</strong> is a cozy game that blends productivity with affection. Adopt a virtual pet and help it grow while you focus on real-life tasks \u2014 using the Pomodoro technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you'll get to experience the core gameplay loop: <strong>start focus sessions</strong>, <strong>track your pet\u2019s progress</strong>, and unlock <strong>small treats and interactions</strong> as you hit your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/extras/48147ad78f499d5e1623cb3009f7d920.poster.avif?t=1749263930\" width=650 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/extras/48147ad78f499d5e1623cb3009f7d920.webm?t=1749263930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/extras/48147ad78f499d5e1623cb3009f7d920.mp4?t=1749263930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and name your first virtual pet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Pomodoro cycles (25 min focus + 5 min break) to earn productivity points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, play with, and evolve your pet using your earned rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress with a light, user-friendly interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover how to turn your routine into a fun and rewarding journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo offers a glimpse into the core mechanics of the full game, focused on blending self-care and casual gaming. Perfect for anyone looking to stay motivated \u2014 with a touch of cuteness.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529750?t=1749263930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529750?t=1749263930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/ced454fce7484e337588dab81cf65bee5eafc8c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749263930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/ced454fce7484e337588dab81cf65bee5eafc8c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749263930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3574480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/extras/ed82adb4867a9d7280064043da77f55c.poster.avif?t=1749263930\" width=650 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529750/extras/ed82adb4867a9d7280064043da77f55c.webm?t=1749263930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati